--- | --- |  \n| aipan  | Uttarakhand  | floor/wall painting  | 6  |  \n| bengal_school  | West Bengal  | painting  | 1287  |  \n| bhil  | Madhya Pradesh / Rajasthan / Gujarat  | painting  | 52  |  \n| bikaner  | Rajasthan  | miniature painting  | 172  |  \n| bundi  | Rajasthan  | miniature painting  | 185  |  \n| cheriyal  | Telangana  | scroll painting  | 1292  |  \n| gond  | Madhya Pradesh  | painting  | 1260  |  \n| jaipur  | Rajasthan  | miniature painting  | 264  |  \n| kalamkari  | Andhra Pradesh  | textile/painting  | 1291  |  \n| kalighat  | West Bengal  | painting  | 2165  |  \n| kangra  | Himachal Pradesh  | miniature painting  | 566  |  \n| kerala_mural  | Kerala  | mural/wall painting  | 842  |  \n| kishangarh  | Rajasthan  | miniature painting  | 176  |  \n| kota  | Rajasthan  | miniature painting  | 178  |  \n| madhubani  | Bihar  | painting  | 1257  |  \n| mandana  | Rajasthan  | floor/wall painting  | 175  |  \n| manjusha  | Bihar  | painting  | 7  |  \n| mewar  | Rajasthan  | miniature painting  | 818  |  \n| mughal_miniature  | Mughal Empire (Pan-India)  | miniature painting  | 2056  |  \n| mysore  | Karnataka  | painting  | 56  |  \n| nirmal  | Telangana  | painting  | 13  |  \n| pahari  | Himachal Pradesh / Jammu  | miniature painting  | 1142  |  \n| patna_kalam  | Bihar  | painting  | 476  |  \n| pattachitra  | Odisha / West Bengal  | painting  | 2551  |  \n| phad  | Rajasthan  | scroll painting  | 1297  |  \n| pichwai  | Rajasthan  | painting  | 1301  |  \n| pithora  | Gujarat / Rajasthan / Madhya Pradesh  | wall painting  | 292  |  \n| rajput  | Rajasthan  | miniature painting  | 1145  |  \n| rogan  | Gujarat  | fabric painting  | 173  |  \n| saura  | Odisha  | wall painting  | 1219  |  \n| sohrai  | Jharkhand  | wall painting  | 13  |  \n| tanjore  | Tamil Nadu  | painting  | 964  |  \n| thangka  | Sikkim / Ladakh / Arunachal Pradesh  | painting  | 1185  |  \n| warli  | Maharashtra  | painting  | 1263  |  \n**Total** : 27,139 images across 34 styles\n##   ⟨154⟩ Dataset Structure \n\n```\ndataset/\n├── train/          # Training images organized by style\n│   ├── aipan/\n│   ├── bengal_school/\n│   ├── bhil/\n│   └── ... (34 style directories)\n└── metadata.csv    # Full manifest with style, source, dimensions, hash, URLs\n\n```\n\nEach image is:\n  * Minimum 400×400 pixels (permissive filter to preserve portrait/scroll formats)\n  * Sourced from verified museum APIs and cultural archives\n  * Deduplicated using file hash + URL checks\n\n\n##   ⟨155⟩ Data Sources \nImages were collected from:\n  * **Wikimedia Commons** (category verification + subcategory depth traversal)\n  * **Metropolitan Museum of Art API**\n  * **Cleveland Museum of Art API**\n  * **Victoria and Albert Museum (V &A) API**\n  * **Europeana API**\n  * **British Library IIIF**\n  * **Rubin Museum**\n  * **Web Search fallback** (Google Custom Search / Bing Image Search for minority styles)\n\n\n##   ⟨156⟩ Usage \n\n```\nfrom datasets import load_dataset\n\n# Load all styles together\nds = load_dataset(\"sohinipattanayak/indian-art-styles\")\n\n# Load a specific style as a subset\nds = load_dataset(\"sohinipattanayak/indian-art-styles\", name=\"madhubani\")\n\n```\n\n##   ⟨157⟩ License \nImages are sourced from public domain or open-license museum collections (CC BY 4.0 compatible). This dataset compilation is released under **CC BY 4.0**.\n##   ⟨158⟩ Citation \nIf you use this dataset, please cite:\n\n```\n@dataset{indian_art_styles_2026,\n  title={Indian Art Styles Image Dataset},\n  author={Pattanayak, Sohini},\n  year={2026},\n  publisher={Hugging Face},\n  url={https://huggingface.co/datasets/sohinipattanayak/indian-art-styles}\n}\n\n```\n\nCopy to bucket new\nUse this dataset \n\nDownloads last month\n    237\nNumber of rows: 23,881 Total file size: 2.72 GB\nSystem theme\nCompany\nTOS⟨160⟩ Privacy⟨161⟩ About⟨162⟩ Careers⟨163⟩ ⟨1⟩\nWebsite\nModels⟨2⟩ Datasets⟨3⟩ Spaces⟨4⟩ Pricing⟨8⟩ Docs⟨6⟩\n",
